@startuml
title ATM Control - Greet User and Check PIN

[*] --> Greeting

state Greeting
Greeting : do / Display Welcome Message

state CardInserted
CardInserted : entry / Card Inserted
CardInserted : do / Get PIN

state ValidPIN
ValidPIN : entry / Correct PIN
ValidPIN : do / Display Menu
ValidPIN : exit / User Chooses Option

state IncorrectPIN
IncorrectPIN : entry / Invalid or Incorrect PIN
IncorrectPIN : do / Check Attempts
IncorrectPIN --> CardConfiscated : Too Many Attempts
IncorrectPIN --> CardInserted : Allow Another Try

state CardConfiscated
CardConfiscated : entry / Card Confiscated for Security
CardConfiscated : do / Display Confiscation Message
CardConfiscated : exit / Return Card to User

state CancelledOperation
CancelledOperation : entry / User Cancels Operation
CancelledOperation : do / Return Card to User
CancelledOperation : exit / End Session

@enduml
